        "jsonBody": "={\"from\": \"Mobile Craft Bars <leads@mobilecraftbars.com>\", \"to\": \"{{ $('Extract Booking Data').item.json.customerEmail }}\", \"reply_to\": \"mobilecraftbars@gmail.com\", \"subject\": \"You're booked, {{ $('Extract Booking Data').item.json.customerFirstName }}! Your Mobile Craft Bars discovery call is confirmed\", \"html\": \"<div style='font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;max-width:560px;'><p>Hi {{ $('Extract Booking Data').item.json.customerFirstName }},</p><p>You're booked. James is looking forward to chatting with you about your {{ $('Extract Booking Data').item.json.eventType.toLowerCase() }}.</p><p><strong>Here's how the call will go:</strong></p><ol style='padding-left:18px;line-height:1.6;'><li>A 10-minute chat about your event details and what experience you want for your guests</li><li>Menu concepts, ingredient sourcing, and what setup options make sense for your venue</li><li>A custom quote within 24 hours of the call. No pressure to decide on the spot.</li></ol><p><strong>Quick prep:</strong> If you have specific cocktails in mind, a venue address, or anything unusual about the setup (rooftop, outdoor, multiple stations), jot it down. We'll talk through it on the call.</p><p>Check your inbox for the calendar invite from Calendly with the call link and exact time.</p><p>Need to reschedule? Just reply to this email and we'll find a new time.</p><p>Talk soon,<br>James Menkel<br>Mobile Craft Bars</p></div>\"}",
